        "original_id": "fc51bb28-6012-5660-8fff-e980dbda795b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 67th Annual Tony Awards\n- People: Julie Taymor, Garry Hynes\n- Awards: Tony Awards\n- Topics: Broadway productions, theater, opera, film\n\nFacts:\n- The 67th Annual Tony Awards were held on June 9, 2013, to recognize achievement in Broadway productions during the 2012–13 season.\n- Garry Hynes and Julie Taymor had previously won Tony Awards in 1998.\n- Julie Taymor was born on December 15, 1952.\n- Julie Taymor is an American director of theater, opera, and film.\n- Julie Taymor is best known for directing the stage musical \"The Lion King.\"\n- Julie Taymor became the first woman to win the Tony Award for directing a musical for \"The Lion King.\"\n- Julie Taymor also won a Tony Award for Original Costume Design for \"The Lion King.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
